  offerLine: 'Your larder''s empty! Take the path at the side of the cafe into the bush. Here''s a trick: decide what you''re looking out for before you go. Choose Greens, and you''ll find far more leaves.'
  activeLine: 'Three handfuls of leaves. Remember: look out for Greens, and they''ll practically jump into your basket.'
  readyLine: See? Look out for something, and you'll find more of it. Keep the leaves, they're for your salad.
  doneLine: Off you go. You set the menu at the cafe door.
